# Belt-and-braces: this file sits at the API root. The correct webserver
# docroot is api/public/. If the docroot is ever misconfigured to api/
# itself, this .htaccess deny-all prevents the source tree, vendor files,
# .env, logs and composer.* from being served.
#
# When docroot is correctly api/public/, this file is never read — Apache
# only processes .htaccess files inside the docroot and below. Keeping
# this file costs nothing and defends against a common deploy mistake.
Require all denied
